        mediarights:cc-by-2.0 , mediarights:cc-by-2.5 , mediarights:cc-by-3.0 ,
        mediarights:cc-by-4.0 , mediarights:cc-by-sa-2.0 , mediarights:cc-by-sa-2.5 ,
